{"id":"leidenschaft","lemma":"Leidenschaft","pos":"noun","rank":2057,"glosses":["passion (powerful emotion)","passion (desire, often sexual)","passion (fervent interest in something)"],"ipa":"/ˈlaɪ̯dənˌʃaft/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/16/De-Leidenschaft.ogg/De-Leidenschaft.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Leidenschaft","plural":"Leidenschaften"},"examples":[{"text":"Lesen ist meine Leidenschaft.","en":"Reading is my passion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/701089","words":[{"g":"to read"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Sie hat eine Leidenschaft für Kuchen.","en":"She has a passion for cake.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"pie"}]},{"text":"Mich treibt eine Leidenschaft.","en":"I'm driven by my passion.","words":[{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to drive","l":"treiben"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Meine Arbeit erfüllt mich mit Leidenschaft.","en":"I'm passionate about my job.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"toil"},{"g":"to fill","l":"erfüllen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Plötzlich wurden sie von Leidenschaft ergriffen.","en":"They were suddenly overcome with passion.","words":[{"g":"suddenly, abruptly"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"from / of"},null,{"g":"to seize, capture","l":"ergreifen"}]}]}